Package: sysible-cli
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Sysible Linux command-line tool (`sysible`)
 The `sysible` command for Sysible Linux. Ships `sysible verify`, which validates
 that the box is ready for engineering work — network, DNS, SSH, container runtime,
 Ansible, Terraform/OpenTofu, Kubernetes tooling, virtualization, security posture,
 Sysible Controller reachability, and pending updates — with a human-readable report
 or `--json` for automation, and per-area flags (--network/--containers/
 --virtualization/--security).
